    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/5c471cff5c4ed048614e83bb74d05b79.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/5c471cff5c4ed048614e83bb74d05b79.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/5c471cff5c4ed048614e83bb74d05b79.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surreal landscapes of the floating islands of Corel as a young Legend on a quest to discover her past and secure her future. Unleash chain reactions as you learn to control the elements in a fast-paced desert punk\u202faction-adventure.\u202f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/edd59397f8d776436773c407e779e0cc.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/edd59397f8d776436773c407e779e0cc.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/edd59397f8d776436773c407e779e0cc.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE ONE WITH WATER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use water as a weapon in all its forms. Seamlessly transform between liquid and human forms to navigate Corel\u2019s surreal landscapes and battle its dangers. Dissolve into a droplet to slip through cracks and spread water across your surroundings, surge through tubes, crash down as a water bomb, or ascend in a vapor burst.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/46b770c5db241994de55e99b0c676b10.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/46b770c5db241994de55e99b0c676b10.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/46b770c5db241994de55e99b0c676b10.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLOIT THE ELEMENTS \u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water. Lava. Toxic waste. Corruption. Each substance has its own properties, reacting dynamically with the world, its fauna, and with you! Combine and unleash chain reactions to drench, conduct, petrify, explode, and more. Every interaction brings new ways to fight and to explore. Adapt, experiment, and carve your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a10cf7f1d80814b0abe5d5cab4c0b21e.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a10cf7f1d80814b0abe5d5cab4c0b21e.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a10cf7f1d80814b0abe5d5cab4c0b21e.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE WATER, SHAPE FATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the raw power of \u00c6ther\u2014cast crushing waves, weave devastating close-combat attacks, and evolve your abilities to fit your playstyle. Master the shift between offense, tactics, and exploration as you unlock new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/98555cda5308adfe2896ea2b58581cb9.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/98555cda5308adfe2896ea2b58581cb9.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/98555cda5308adfe2896ea2b58581cb9.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP INTO THE ECHOVERSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse Corel and its Shadows, distorted realities of the same world, each with its own laws, dangers, and possibilities. Explore landscapes both familiar and alien to unlock precious \u00c6theric Sources, discover new ways to interact with the world and adapt your approach to each dimension.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/5c471cff5c4ed048614e83bb74d05b79.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/5c471cff5c4ed048614e83bb74d05b79.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/5c471cff5c4ed048614e83bb74d05b79.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surreal landscapes of the floating islands of Corel as a young Legend on a quest to discover her past and secure her future. Unleash chain reactions as you learn to control the elements in a fast-paced desert punk\u202faction-adventure.\u202f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/edd59397f8d776436773c407e779e0cc.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/edd59397f8d776436773c407e779e0cc.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/edd59397f8d776436773c407e779e0cc.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE ONE WITH WATER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use water as a weapon in all its forms. Seamlessly transform between liquid and human forms to navigate Corel\u2019s surreal landscapes and battle its dangers. Dissolve into a droplet to slip through cracks and spread water across your surroundings, surge through tubes, crash down as a water bomb, or ascend in a vapor burst.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/46b770c5db241994de55e99b0c676b10.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/46b770c5db241994de55e99b0c676b10.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/46b770c5db241994de55e99b0c676b10.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLOIT THE ELEMENTS \u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water. Lava. Toxic waste. Corruption. Each substance has its own properties, reacting dynamically with the world, its fauna, and with you! Combine and unleash chain reactions to drench, conduct, petrify, explode, and more. Every interaction brings new ways to fight and to explore. Adapt, experiment, and carve your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a10cf7f1d80814b0abe5d5cab4c0b21e.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a10cf7f1d80814b0abe5d5cab4c0b21e.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/a10cf7f1d80814b0abe5d5cab4c0b21e.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE WATER, SHAPE FATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the raw power of \u00c6ther\u2014cast crushing waves, weave devastating close-combat attacks, and evolve your abilities to fit your playstyle. Master the shift between offense, tactics, and exploration as you unlock new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/98555cda5308adfe2896ea2b58581cb9.poster.avif?t=1749329043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/98555cda5308adfe2896ea2b58581cb9.webm?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/98555cda5308adfe2896ea2b58581cb9.mp4?t=1749329043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP INTO THE ECHOVERSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse Corel and its Shadows, distorted realities of the same world, each with its own laws, dangers, and possibilities. Explore landscapes both familiar and alien to unlock precious \u00c6theric Sources, discover new ways to interact with the world and adapt your approach to each dimension.</p>",
    "short_description": "Unleash water, harness elements, and trigger chain reactions in a fast-paced desert punk action-adventure. Shift and slide through the surreal realities of a reactive world that rewards creativity. Play as One, a young Legend on a quest to discover her past and secure her future.",
